  "textBindings": [
    {
      "ref": "p0110#4",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0110/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "38bd12c06d29ce3ac4b78b4455e7ee85ca4a3d29658fcdaee51e3981e9ebb895",
      "printedPage": 100,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "在横波传播时，当振动传到了第十三个球后，第一个和第",
        "十三个球将作完全相同的振动。当第一个球在平衡位置上并",
        "向左运动时（见图70д），第十三个球也在平衡位置，并且也向左",
        "运动。又过了$\\frac{1}{4}$周期，第一个球向左运动到最大偏移位置，",
        "第十三个球同样也到达这样的位置（见图70е）。这两个球的",
        "振动相位总是相同的。**相距最近的振动相位相同的两个点间",
        "的距离叫做波长。**所以，第一个球和第十三个球之间的距离，",
        "第二个球和第十四个球之间的距离，第三个球和第十五个球",
        "之间的距离都等于波长（见图70д、е）。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0110#5",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0110/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "38bd12c06d29ce3ac4b78b4455e7ee85ca4a3d29658fcdaee51e3981e9ebb895",
      "printedPage": 100,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "相应于图71б所示的纵波的波长等于第二个球与第十四",
        "个球之间的距离，或第四个球与第十六个球之间的距离。波",
        "长用希腊字母$\\lambda$表示。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0110#6",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0110/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "38bd12c06d29ce3ac4b78b4455e7ee85ca4a3d29658fcdaee51e3981e9ebb895",
      "printedPage": 100,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "在波传播的时候，物体的不同的点（如在所观察的模型上",
        "的各球），只要它们之间的距离不等于$n\\lambda$（$n$为整数），就各以",
        "不同的相位振动。相距为$\\lambda/2$的第一个球和第七个球（见图"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": true
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#1",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "70）以相反的相位振动：当第一个球向左运动时，第七个球",
        "就向右移动，反过来也是这样。"
      ],
      "continuation": true,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#2",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "在一个周期之内波传播的距离为$\\lambda$（见图70д）。所以波",
        "的速度可用下面公式求出：",
        "$v=\\frac{\\lambda}{T}$　(4.1)",
        "因为周期$T$和频率$\\nu$的相互关系为",
        "$T=\\frac{1}{\\nu}$，",
        "所以　$v=\\lambda\\nu$　(4.2)"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#3",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "**波的速度等于波长和振动频率的乘积。**"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#4",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "当波在绳中传播时，我们就遇到了两种类型的周期性。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#5",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "第一，绳的每一个质点都随时间作周期性的振动。在谐",
        "振动的情况下（这些振动是按正弦或余弦规律进行的），所有的",
        "质点的频率和振幅都是相同的，振动的区别仅仅在于相位。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#6",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "第二，任一时刻在空间中，每隔一段长为$\\lambda$的绳，就出现",
        "重复的波形。图72所示的就是某一时刻的波形（过$O$点的曲",
        "线）。随着时间的推移，整个图形从左向右以速度$v$移动。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#7",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "fig",
      "lines": [],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#8",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "cap",
      "lines": [
        "图72"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0111#9",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0111/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "026737f889528a26cca8e44e4df851f97e18a95daa6ffa12676ef043c6334c51",
      "printedPage": 101,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "经过一段时间"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": true
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#1",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "$\\Delta t=\\frac{\\Delta s}{v}$",
        "波将具有图中不过$O$点的曲线所示的形式。"
      ],
      "continuation": true,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#2",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "p",
      "lines": [
        "表示波的传播速度、波长和振动频率之间关系的(4.2)",
        "式，对于纵波也是适用的。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#4",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lines": [
        "1. 什么叫做波？"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#5",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lines": [
        "2. 横波与纵波的区别是什么？举出横波与纵波的例子。"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#6",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lines": [
        "3. 波动的基本特点是什么？"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#7",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lines": [
        "4. 什么叫做波长？"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#8",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
      "pageSha256": "43cc05a119dd648147a36c260918d8307ad25958f3141b2e0ad43a806135ebd9",
      "printedPage": 102,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lines": [
        "5. 波速与波长有何联系？"
      ],
      "continuation": false,
      "open": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0112#9",
      "path": ".intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d044-wave-preparation/root/10p/pages/0112/page.json",
